<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">AgentRL</span>: Scaling Agentic Reinforcement Learning with a Multi-Turn, Multi-Task Framework</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
