<div id="S4.I1.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I1.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I1.ix1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">We provide a one-shot demonstration for Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct in ALFWorld evaluation, as it fails to generate valid tool call format in the environment.</span></p>
